OL,3,A'The reason we lost is the war,' JD
OL,4,AVance says after Democrats sweep to
OL,5,Aresounding midterms win
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Democrats win the Senate and the
OL,8,FHouse in US midterm elections, taking
OL,9,Fcontrol of Congress for the rest of
OL,10,FDonald Trump's presidency
OL,12,F"The reason we lost is the war," US
OL,13,FVice-President JD Vance says
OL,15,FTrump also acknowledges the Iran war,
OL,16,Fand the rising cost of living, were
OL,17,Ffactors in his Republican Party's
OL,18,Fdefeat - as the White House posts on
OL,19,Fsocial media: "Trump is still your
OL,20,Fpresident"
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
