OL,3,A'The reason we lost is the war,' JD
OL,4,AVance says after Democrats sweep to
OL,5,Aresounding midterms win
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn Senate races, Democrats picked up a
OL,8,Fstring of victories in Republican
OL,9,Fstrongholds including Texas, South
OL,10,FCarolina and Kansas
OL,12,FWe're yet to hear results in Alaska and
OL,13,FMississippi - and it could be weeks
OL,14,Fbefore we know the outcome of Alaska's
OL,15,FSenate race
OL,17,FTop Democrat in the House Hakeem
OL,18,FJeffries calls his party's victory a
OL,19,F"red, white and blue moment". Some
OL,20,Fseats in the lower chamber are still
OL,21,Fbeing counted - but the Democrats have
OL,22,Fsurpassed the 218 needed to win
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
